⭐ MOST IMPORTANT DIFFERENCES
=============================

Array vs ArrayList
------------------
Array:
- Fixed size
- Can store primitives
- int[], String[]

ArrayList:
- Dynamic size
- Stores objects/wrapper types
- ArrayList<Integer>


HashMap vs HashSet
------------------
HashMap:
Key -> Value

HashSet:
Only unique values


String vs StringBuilder
-----------------------
String:
Immutable
Cannot directly change existing String

StringBuilder:
Mutable
Can modify existing object


for vs while
------------
for:
Usually when number of iterations is known

while:
Usually when condition controls the loop


